        1250,
        325
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "MONETARY LUMP SUM PAYMENT IN LIEU OF ACCRUED ANNUAL LEAVE AND/OR COMPENSATORY TIME TO EMPLOYEES WHO RETIRE DUE TO REDUCTION OF STAFF FOR ECONOMIC REASONS.",
      "logprob_stats": {
